@startuml UC14_Send_Warnings_Activity_Diagram

title UC14: Send Warnings - Activity Diagram

start
:Scheduler triggers warning detection job;
:System checks stored forecast data
for danger/warning flags by (city, service) combinations;
:System identifies (city, service) pairs
with life-threatening weather conditions;

if (Hazards detected?) then (yes)
  repeat
    :Select next affected (city, service) pair;
    :System invokes UC11 (Receive Warning Notification);
    :System logs warning event;
    :System tracks notification delivery status;
  repeat while (More affected (city, service) pairs?) is (yes)
  ->no;
else (no hazards)
  :System completes normally;
endif

stop

@enduml
